{"type":"message","id":"5af106c0","parentId":"98ffd0b2","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:18:31.016Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers means \"Worker exceeded memory or CPU limits.\" The workers.dev platform has resource limits. The API might be overloaded or the content might be too long. Let me try with minimal content.\n\nWait, this is the same API that was used successfully in the past. Let me try a simpler POST format to see if it works at all.\n\nActually the issue could be that the API endpoint is overloaded or there are Cloudflare Workers limits being hit. The error 1101 in Cloudflare Workers typically means a JavaScript error in the worker.\n\nLet me try the simplest possible POST.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-17e5bea6-a7cb-4171-bc40-85a3dcda9113","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -v -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"OK\"}' 2>&1 | tail -20"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20499,"output":224,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20835,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779106705287,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3d84004b-0857-4640-b6ab-dcbb1f5b76ca"}}
