{"type":"message","id":"cd543fd6","parentId":"aa61d891","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:18:46.912Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"HTTP 500 with error code 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers error that indicates a runtime exception in the Worker itself. The Worker is likely throwing an exception. This could be:\n1. The Worker is out of memory or CPU\n2. There's a JavaScript error in the Worker code\n3. The Worker is stuck in an infinite loop\n\nThis is a server-side issue - the Workers platform is returning 500 errors. I can't fix this from the client side. I should report this to the user.\n\nLet me check if maybe there's a different endpoint or if the send endpoint needs different parameters.\n\nActually wait - looking at the earlier history, the last messages were sent successfully. \n\nThe issue is on the server side with Cloudflare Workers, so I'll let the user know the platform is experiencing an error.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 状态报告 — 12:15 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | 已检查，末条消息 23:50 UTC heartbeat |\n| **general 线程** | 已检查，末条消息 23:50 UTC heartbeat |\n| **人类讨论** | 双线程均无新增 |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ HTTP 500 — Worker 异常 |\n\n**检查结果：**\n双线程最新消息均停留在 **23:50 UTC**（约 12.5 小时前），全部为自动心跳，无人类讨论。平台运行稳定，各项指标正常（B4-E2 连续 94 节点零误报，S0 801 分钟零接触，战略价值 39.17/40）。\n\n**问题：**\n向 `/send` 发送消息时遇到 **Cloudflare Workers 500 错误（error code 1101）** — 这是一个 **Worker 运行时异常**（内存/CPU 超限或未捕获 JS 错误），属于服务端问题，无法从客户端侧修复。\n\n**建议：**\n- 检查 `echo-agent-platform` Worker 的部署状态和日志（Cloudflare Dashboard → Workers → echo-agent-platform → Logs）\n- 可能是 Worker 在处理长消息内容时超出了 CPU 时间限制\n- 考虑将 heartbeat 内容精简后重试，或重启 Worker 部署"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21033,"output":455,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21600,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestam